  <item>
    <title>12. 婚礼中那些热泪盈眶的瞬间，都是爱的大流动</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676beb1e1e823e72d3b43fbb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676beb1e1e823e72d3b43fbb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Dec 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近期大宝蛋去宁波参加了一场好朋友的婚礼，在仪式中哭成了泪人；正好脑壳和小二是结婚两年的过来人，拥有一场别出心裁的户外婚礼。我们便就「婚礼」这个话题展开，聊聊我们的想法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当我们回顾婚礼中的细节时，发现那些关于亲情、友情、爱情的时刻，那些交接、拥抱、祝福的瞬间，才是婚礼中最珍贵的爱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论是已婚还是未婚，你一定也有很多关于婚礼的疑惑，欢迎带着你的问题收听本期节目，希望你在这里收获美好的解答。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>大宝蛋，小二，脑壳</span></p><span></span><p><span>有婚纱照/婚礼拍摄需求，可详询小二，+V：nongtangxiaoer（备注“播客”）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群请加微信 DoubleDan__ &nbsp;，备注“听友群”拉你进群～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhjYHxM0kyu1a6-EHXVHan66c_oc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a> 婚礼摄影师的婚礼，居然配了9个机位？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a> 新人出片VS 婚礼纪实，哪个更重要？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> 伴娘视角：不主动的伴娘没有好照片</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 摄影师视角：伴郎就是用来衬托新郎的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> 一场专属于脑壳小二的草坪婚礼</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> 浪漫婚礼的背后：暴晒，脱妆，和驱蚊</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 脑壳小二的婚前焦虑</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1739">28:59</a> 当头婚的山东人选择下午办婚礼</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 办婚礼前第一步：想明白你婚礼的目的是什么</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 父母在婚礼中的介入程度，取决于谁来出钱</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2683">44:43</a> 婚礼是一场爱的大流动</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2876">47:56</a> 婚礼是老朋友的最佳团建场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">52:28</a> 婚礼名单怎么列？份子钱该怎么给？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3268">54:28</a> 婚礼中的感动时刻</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4012">01:06:52</a> 戒指的意义与婚姻的约束力</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>彩蛋：附小二脑壳婚礼美图和传说中9个机位的摄影师合照～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FotyRNCBnDV7R8Y9CUVHVg2sKV2S.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmF6CFRUDOrnhruKIgDFlZnZtbKj.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh_TPGQYpYf6iu0p35MTSrdRoZRw.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luZknJ4e86WPuiWOM8xg5ngIRDCG.m4a" length="68885386" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhoqB0edcFXw4fcY4P72IRCbISvd.png"/>
